I don't send replies like this one to the list, since the person who needs 
the help can't see list messages, and the others on the list don't really 
need to be bothered by what is really a list-config question.

Now I don't *know* what happened to your sub, but I do notice that your 
account is at hotmail, and hotmail mailboxes often fill up and start 
bouncing mail. The linux-newbie list, like many mailing lists, includes a 
system that checks bounces and tries to automatically unsubscribe any 
address that bounces. So my *guess* is that that is what happened to you.

The solution is to resubscribe. If you stop seeing list traffic, that 
should always be your first attempted solution (since if you are already 
subscribed, the attempt to resubscribe will fail with that message).

